  "factor_name": "DXY-stretch conditioned volatility-scaled residual reversal",
  "version": "1.0",
  "calculation": {
    "expression": "shift1(-(ret_20 - cross_sectional_mean(ret_20))/(rolling_std(daily_returns,60)*sqrt(20)) * (1 + 0.35*abs(clip(zscore(20d DXY return,120),-2,2)))",
    "description": "Ranks assets for reversal of lagged 20-session cross-sectional residual returns, scaled by 20-session realized volatility. The reversal magnitude is increased when the observation-only DXY 20-session return is unusually stretched. Every input is shifted one completed session before use, preventing look-ahead. DXY is never traded."
  },
